OL,3,AMan in court charged with murder after
OL,4,Afire deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FWright, of no fixed address, was
OL,7,Fremanded in custody during the hearing
OL,8,Fthat lasted less than two minutes, and
OL,9,Fis next due to appear at Teesside Crown
OL,10,FCourt on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
