OL,3,ALaundry rooms to be turned into cells
OL,4,Ato tackle prison overcrowding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government is to create more cells
OL,7,Fin existing prisons in England and
OL,8,FWales as part of its plans to tackle
OL,9,Fovercrowding.
OL,11,FAn investment of #110m, which will come
OL,12,Ffrom existing budgets, will be used to
OL,13,Fconvert unused office space, laundry
OL,14,Frooms and storage space into cells, the
OL,15,FMinistry of Justice said.
OL,17,FJustice Secretary Alex Norris is also
OL,18,Fdue to give more details in the Commons
OL,19,Flater on changes to the early release
OL,20,Fscheme, which aims to free up space in
OL,21,Fprisons as they near maximum capacity.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
