OL,3,AIsraeli fire kills three in Gaza City
OL,4,Aduring reported raid, medics say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least two Palestinian children and a
OL,7,Fwoman have been killed by Israeli fire
OL,8,Fin western Gaza City, Palestinian
OL,9,Fmedics say.
OL,11,FUnconfirmed local reports say that an
OL,12,FIsrael-backed Palestinian militia
OL,13,Fcarried out a raid and that the Israeli
OL,14,Fmilitary carried out shelling and air
OL,15,Fstrikes after it was discovered.
OL,17,FA third child was killed in a separate
OL,18,Fincident in central Gaza.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
