OL,3,AIsraeli fire kills three in Gaza City
OL,4,Aduring reported raid, medics say
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsraeli Defence Minister Israel Katz
OL,7,Fsaid that a senior Hamas official had
OL,8,Fbeen arrested, but it is not clear
OL,9,Fwhether the announcement is related to
OL,10,Fthe incident in Gaza City.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
